    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33615" root="فرع" body-key="f">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افترع</span></b> : see 4, latter half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Hence, (TA,)
<i>He devirginated</i> a maid; (S, O, Msb, K, TA;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرَعَهَا</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افترع قَصِيدَةَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَذَا</span> (tropical:)  [<i>He broached such an ode</i>], and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَانِىَ كَذَا</span>
[<i>such meanings</i>]: (Har p. 61:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفْتَرِعُ أَبْكَارَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَعَانِى</span> (tropical:)  [<i>He broaches virgin meanings</i>]. (TA,
and Har ubi suprà.)

